WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 35]

01:45.900 --> 01:48.360
Why did you summon the Bone-Corroding Harp?

01:51.020 --> 01:52.479
The Bone-Corroding Harp?

01:54.259 --> 01:55.320
I didn't summon it.

01:58.580 --> 01:59.340
Could it be

02:01.620 --> 02:02.580
it thinks

02:03.700 --> 02:05.300
I've become the Demon Queen?

02:08.500 --> 02:10.100
You won't be the Demon Queen.

02:10.860 --> 02:11.390
Luo Ning,

02:16.020 --> 02:18.020
the merging wine you just drank

02:18.260 --> 02:20.060
was made from the Phoenix Tears.

02:20.610 --> 02:21.870
It will make you forget

02:22.220 --> 02:23.780
all the people

02:24.300 --> 02:25.430
and things you love.

02:27.140 --> 02:28.070
What did you say?

02:30.100 --> 02:32.300
Forget all the people and things I love?

02:33.460 --> 02:34.780
Then I'll forget...

02:36.100 --> 02:36.540
No.

02:37.740 --> 02:38.250
No.

02:42.140 --> 02:43.579
Don't struggle to hold on.

02:43.579 --> 02:45.340
You'll soon forget He Na.

02:46.060 --> 02:46.900
You

02:47.140 --> 02:48.420
have always been willful.

02:48.420 --> 02:48.820
No.

02:49.300 --> 02:50.220
You will never marry

02:50.220 --> 02:52.130
a stranger, right?

02:52.660 --> 02:53.140
No.

02:55.660 --> 02:56.060
No.

03:00.300 --> 03:01.740
He Na should be here soon.

03:02.700 --> 03:04.160
What's wrong with Mr. Tai?

03:04.980 --> 03:05.860
I saw through

03:06.340 --> 03:07.860
his scheme easily.

03:08.660 --> 03:09.980
So I put

03:10.100 --> 03:11.940
the tampered clothes

03:12.140 --> 03:13.340
in a beautiful place.

03:14.100 --> 03:15.700
And I just wait for my brother

03:15.980 --> 03:17.860
to bring the people from the Immortal Palace

03:17.860 --> 03:19.060
to step into the trap.

03:19.980 --> 03:20.579
No.

03:21.940 --> 03:22.579
Fu.

03:23.900 --> 03:25.020
It's not He Na.

03:25.500 --> 03:27.140
Stop doing bad things.

03:28.890 --> 03:29.420
Luo Ning.

03:30.300 --> 03:31.140
Forget He Na.

03:31.380 --> 03:32.380
Let's start over.

03:34.300 --> 03:35.220
Fu.

03:36.100 --> 03:37.090
Fu.

03:38.820 --> 03:39.700
No.

03:45.340 --> 03:46.260
Fairy Luo Ning,

03:47.020 --> 03:48.550
although it's one day late,

03:48.700 --> 03:50.960
I still want to wish you a happy birthday.

03:53.250 --> 03:54.420
How about I be your brother?

03:54.420 --> 03:56.100
I am

03:56.100 --> 03:58.579
about 1,000 years old this year.

03:57.700 --> 04:04.430
♫In the sea of clouds, I looked at the reflection of the moon in the water♫

03:59.700 --> 04:01.780
General of Water,

04:02.420 --> 04:03.770
how old are you?

04:04.260 --> 04:05.300
I'm almost 1,000 years old.

04:05.300 --> 04:06.420
Almost 1,000 years old?

04:06.420 --> 04:10.590
♫I kept waiting and arched my palms into a circle♫

04:06.580 --> 04:07.910
That means you haven't.

04:08.860 --> 04:09.720
Call me sister.

04:10.980 --> 04:11.460
Sister.

04:12.170 --> 04:18.410
♫The reflection gradually reminded me of our first meeting♫

04:12.780 --> 04:13.620
Fu.

04:13.620 --> 04:15.380
You look ugly wearing this.

04:17.820 --> 04:19.660
Whether you find a way or not,

04:19.110 --> 04:24.300
♫I can no longer tell the difference between wind and rain♫

04:20.300 --> 04:22.100
you have to promise me one thing.

04:22.180 --> 04:23.580
Don't come back too late.

04:25.510 --> 04:29.150
♫Even if I get the volley sword♫

04:25.540 --> 04:26.620
Fu.

04:27.060 --> 04:28.620
I don't want to forget.

04:29.460 --> 04:31.340
I know you're bad.

04:29.670 --> 04:33.170
♫I can't forget you♫

04:31.860 --> 04:34.300
I know you've done a lot of bad things.

04:33.170 --> 04:36.760
♫Our destiny has been sealed long ago♫

04:35.100 --> 04:37.340
But I still don't want to forget you.

04:37.010 --> 04:39.780
♫I have no other choice♫

04:38.820 --> 04:40.220
Fu.

04:39.780 --> 04:43.340
♫Why have you been so far away from me every time♫

04:43.340 --> 04:46.170
♫For billions of years♫

04:46.730 --> 04:50.390
♫Can I use your hands to warm up the world again?♫

04:47.500 --> 04:47.860
No.

04:47.860 --> 04:48.700
You're sure

04:48.700 --> 04:50.390
that my feelings for you are real. -No.

04:50.390 --> 04:53.310
♫A few hasty nights♫

04:50.420 --> 04:51.220
From the beginning,

04:51.220 --> 04:51.940
Fu.

04:52.220 --> 04:53.480
all my feelings for you

04:53.500 --> 04:55.460
are part of your plan, right?

04:53.740 --> 04:57.510
♫Too many intertwined oaths and lies♫

04:56.460 --> 04:57.510
Even you dislike me

04:57.510 --> 05:00.920
♫Have shattered my dreams♫

04:58.220 --> 04:59.950
because I am an aquatic monster

04:59.980 --> 05:01.260
that will die without water, right?

05:00.920 --> 05:07.700
♫Who would like to take a broken willow branch And watch the moon alone in the blue sky♫

05:02.660 --> 05:03.940
From now on,

05:05.700 --> 05:07.620
I don't want to see you again

05:22.570 --> 05:29.750
♫The remaining flowers in the mirror reflect the moon in the water♫

05:25.300 --> 05:27.340
No, Fu.

05:31.020 --> 05:35.670
♫We can't live up to such a good time♫

05:36.720 --> 05:43.200
♫Recalling the unforgettable glance at the beginning♫

05:43.620 --> 05:44.020
No.

05:43.730 --> 05:47.270
♫I realized that it was a thousand years ago♫

05:44.740 --> 05:46.420
I can't remember.

05:46.659 --> 05:47.980
I seem to remember

05:47.270 --> 05:50.330
♫Is this bad luck, or good luck?♫

05:48.540 --> 05:50.980
there's a boy who looks evil and handsome while smiling.

05:50.330 --> 05:53.950
♫He said that responsibility and love are difficult to balance♫

05:50.980 --> 05:52.260
He became a lunatic.

05:52.540 --> 05:54.020
I want him to be normal.

05:53.950 --> 05:56.780
♫He had no choice but to leave me♫

05:54.340 --> 05:55.300
I did it for him.

05:55.659 --> 05:56.860
I want to marry He Na.

05:57.300 --> 05:59.140
I want to lift that eternal curse.

05:57.470 --> 06:01.020
♫The past has passed, so do not linger♫

05:59.780 --> 06:01.460
But who is that boy?

06:01.020 --> 06:03.730
♫My love for you is still so strong♫

06:01.900 --> 06:03.460
-Why can't I remember? -Luo Ning.

06:03.460 --> 06:04.140
Luo Ning.

06:04.360 --> 06:08.050
♫Too many intertwined oaths and lies♫

06:04.420 --> 06:05.740
Who is that boy?

06:06.180 --> 06:07.780
Who is he?

06:08.050 --> 06:11.610
♫Have shattered my dreams♫

06:08.180 --> 06:10.250
I don't want to forget him.

06:10.890 --> 06:13.020
But I can't remember.

06:11.610 --> 06:19.550
♫Who would like to take a broken willow branch and watch the moon alone in the blue sky♫

06:13.660 --> 06:15.220
Who is he?

06:15.860 --> 06:17.610
Who is he?

06:19.320 --> 06:19.900
Luo Ning.

06:19.970 --> 06:23.420
♫Life is like a grain of sand♫

06:23.420 --> 06:26.850
♫It burns the fire in my heart♫

06:26.020 --> 06:26.700
Luo Ning.

06:27.040 --> 06:34.870
♫I want to burn myself to hear you say you have never changed♫

06:27.940 --> 06:28.700
Luo Ning.

06:29.140 --> 06:29.820
Luo Ning!

06:34.900 --> 06:35.500
Luo Ning.

06:36.060 --> 06:37.140
Luo Ning, wake up!

06:37.980 --> 06:38.620
Luo Ning!

06:53.420 --> 06:54.220
Your Majesty.

06:54.820 --> 06:57.020
Follow my moss,

06:57.420 --> 06:58.620
you will know

06:58.740 --> 07:00.420
where General Fu is.

07:47.060 --> 07:48.120
Protection Spell?

08:05.610 --> 08:06.260
How is she?

08:09.340 --> 08:10.500
General Fu,

08:10.500 --> 08:11.740
Fairy is fine.

08:12.100 --> 08:12.860
She's fine?

08:14.900 --> 08:16.140
She has been in a coma

08:16.140 --> 08:17.060
since she took the Phoenix Tears

08:17.060 --> 08:17.940
How could you say she's fine?

08:17.940 --> 08:19.140
Fairy is indeed fine.

08:19.500 --> 08:21.560
And she's pregnant for three months.

08:22.180 --> 08:22.740
You mean

08:24.340 --> 08:25.540
Luo Ning is pregnant?

08:27.300 --> 08:28.180
Three months?

08:29.380 --> 08:31.240
Isn't that when we were together?

08:40.980 --> 08:41.530
Luo Ning.

08:43.059 --> 08:43.659
Luo Ning.

08:51.540 --> 08:52.400
Can you hear me?

08:53.090 --> 08:54.340
We have our own child.

09:12.540 --> 09:13.100
Liu Shao.

09:14.580 --> 09:15.220
Liu Shao.

09:19.020 --> 09:19.570
Luo Ge.

09:19.860 --> 09:22.060
Why didn't you take me along to find Luo Ning?

09:22.060 --> 09:23.420
How can I rest assured

09:23.540 --> 09:24.870
in the Immortal Palace?

09:25.420 --> 09:27.620
Luo Ning has the Glazed Pearl I gave her.

09:28.380 --> 09:29.840
I tried to feel it just now.

09:30.220 --> 09:31.880
She doesn't seem to be nearby,

09:32.860 --> 09:34.060
but in the northeast.

09:34.100 --> 09:35.760
She's at least 100 miles away.

09:35.820 --> 09:36.700
That is…

09:40.570 --> 09:41.700
The Ice Rock Lake.

09:43.660 --> 09:44.700
Ice Rock Lake?

09:45.580 --> 09:45.980
Yes.

10:02.010 --> 10:02.580
Liu Shao.

10:04.530 --> 10:07.340
Isn't that the place where we found the Bone-Corroding Harp?

10:07.340 --> 10:09.820
It's extremely unfavorable to the Melody race.

10:09.820 --> 10:11.220
Why is Fu there?

10:33.460 --> 10:33.990
Luo Ning.

10:34.980 --> 10:35.780
You're awake.

10:39.860 --> 10:41.300
Who are you?

10:47.420 --> 10:50.190
[Happy]

10:49.020 --> 10:49.940
Tell me.

10:50.580 --> 10:52.060
What's your name?

10:53.740 --> 10:54.500
My name is Fu.

10:57.140 --> 10:58.500
You look nice.

10:59.020 --> 11:01.150
But my brother is still more handsome.

11:02.460 --> 11:03.740
You look

11:04.220 --> 11:05.420
nice.

11:06.340 --> 11:07.740
But my brother

11:08.300 --> 11:09.630
is still more handsome.

11:11.700 --> 11:12.780
You are just

11:13.300 --> 11:14.290
slimmer.

11:17.010 --> 11:19.500
Maybe too slim.

11:23.090 --> 11:24.180
I'll gain weight.

11:26.620 --> 11:28.480
You don't look like a good person.

11:28.660 --> 11:29.580
But

11:29.580 --> 11:31.110
you're quite interesting.

11:32.460 --> 11:34.700
As long as I am interesting to you.

11:40.020 --> 11:40.740
By the way,

11:41.140 --> 11:42.540
why am I here?

11:43.460 --> 11:44.860
I clearly remember that

11:45.170 --> 11:46.180
I was

11:46.660 --> 11:48.380
in the wedding with He Na.

11:48.660 --> 11:49.940
When we were bowing,

11:49.940 --> 11:51.740
he left for something suddenly.

11:51.740 --> 11:53.060
And then...

11:54.820 --> 11:56.150
And then what happened?

11:58.700 --> 12:00.560
Something happened to my brother

12:00.860 --> 12:02.590
so he asked me to bring you here.

12:02.740 --> 12:03.620
Your brother?

12:05.300 --> 12:06.760
So you're He Na's brother.

12:07.540 --> 12:08.020
Yes.

12:09.780 --> 12:10.980
That's strange.

12:11.620 --> 12:13.100
Is there anything more important

12:13.100 --> 12:15.210
than our wedding?

12:19.260 --> 12:19.820
Did you

12:20.700 --> 12:21.540
marry He Na

12:22.220 --> 12:23.820
to lift the curse?

12:25.500 --> 12:26.020
Yes.

12:26.770 --> 12:28.100
That eternal curse

12:28.540 --> 12:30.200
has hurt many Aquatic Demons.

12:32.580 --> 12:33.980
It also hurt that...

12:38.820 --> 12:39.900
that...

12:41.890 --> 12:43.370
It hurt that...

12:47.020 --> 12:48.180
I can't remember.

12:48.210 --> 12:48.860
It hurt me.

12:49.740 --> 12:51.400
It made me do a lot of bad things

12:51.980 --> 12:52.980
that made you sad.

12:53.780 --> 12:55.640
You don't want me to do bad things.

12:56.540 --> 12:58.070
What are you talking about?

12:58.140 --> 12:59.660
I don't know you at all.

12:59.820 --> 13:01.140
What does it have to do

13:01.260 --> 13:02.660
with me?

13:03.180 --> 13:04.580
You really don't know me?

13:07.780 --> 13:09.640
I've been in your room for so long.

13:10.620 --> 13:12.260
Why didn't you drive me away?

13:20.300 --> 13:21.820
Here is not the Immortal Palace,

13:21.820 --> 13:23.020
nor my house.

13:24.260 --> 13:25.520
Don't they look alike?

13:25.860 --> 13:27.580
They do.

13:28.130 --> 13:29.100
But

13:29.460 --> 13:30.920
I feel something's wrong.

13:31.490 --> 13:32.420
It seems

13:33.170 --> 13:34.430
something is missing.

13:34.540 --> 13:36.340
What is missing? Let me help you.

13:38.740 --> 13:39.580
I know.

13:42.500 --> 13:43.380
This is it.

13:46.780 --> 13:47.620
This doll

13:47.900 --> 13:49.130
is made of my clothes.

13:49.980 --> 13:51.180
It means everything

13:51.380 --> 13:52.440
-is from me. -Don't

13:52.580 --> 13:54.500
give me this ugly doll.

13:54.810 --> 13:55.470
Otherwise,

13:55.740 --> 13:56.820
it will destroy

13:56.980 --> 13:59.240
the feng shui of the Waterside Pavilion.

14:00.060 --> 14:01.790
Do you remember this ugly doll?

14:01.980 --> 14:03.210
Of course I do.

14:03.420 --> 14:04.420
Before I got married,

14:03.430 --> 14:08.010
♫I want to get close but I can't see clearly♫

14:04.540 --> 14:05.820
I've packed it up.

14:06.900 --> 14:08.580
This doll is so ugly.

14:08.740 --> 14:13.300
♫Who arranged this rain?♫

14:08.890 --> 14:10.220
Why did I bring it with me

14:10.220 --> 14:11.300
when I got married?

14:12.740 --> 14:13.660
It's strange.

14:14.100 --> 14:15.180
If I don't take it with me,

14:14.420 --> 14:18.930
♫I want to avoid but I meet you again♫

14:15.300 --> 14:17.760
I feel like something is missing in my heart.

14:19.660 --> 14:24.350
♫I can't help but stay with you♫

14:25.530 --> 14:29.990
♫The stars call the morning sky♫

14:30.660 --> 14:35.170
♫May you feel relieved♫

14:31.620 --> 14:32.180
You...

14:32.620 --> 14:33.980
How dare you be rude to me!

14:33.980 --> 14:35.020
My brother and He Na

14:35.020 --> 14:36.020
won't let you off.

14:36.430 --> 14:40.930
♫I long for a hug♫

14:39.660 --> 14:41.500
Even if they won't let me off easily,

14:41.500 --> 14:46.750
♫Can I not just listen?♫

14:43.980 --> 14:45.650
I don't want to let go of you anymore.

14:45.650 --> 14:47.020
What's wrong with you?

14:47.400 --> 14:50.840
♫I want to find our way through destiny♫

14:47.420 --> 14:48.940
You bullied me just now.

14:49.460 --> 14:50.620
Why did you...

14:51.440 --> 14:57.060
♫I want to throw away the memory in exchange for you to come back♫

14:51.580 --> 14:52.420
Nothing.

14:54.380 --> 14:56.380
I just feel a little uncomfortable.

14:57.500 --> 15:02.360
♫Raise the glass to reincarnate the world♫

14:59.580 --> 15:00.660
Why are you hurt?

15:01.180 --> 15:02.020
Seems that

15:02.420 --> 15:04.060
it's burnt from the inside.

15:02.650 --> 15:07.980
♫I'll wait for your response with no regrets♫

15:04.770 --> 15:05.660
Does it hurt?

15:06.620 --> 15:07.420
No.

15:08.060 --> 15:08.990
Don't be afraid.

15:09.080 --> 15:12.740
♫I'll find the promised home for you♫

15:09.580 --> 15:10.540
I'm not afraid.

15:11.290 --> 15:12.180
But

15:12.380 --> 15:13.980
I think I can treat this kind of wound.

15:13.260 --> 15:18.830
♫My heart aches and I will say yes again♫

15:19.260 --> 15:24.610
♫When will we separate?♫

15:24.800 --> 15:32.580
♫Please don't tell us our ending in advance♫

15:43.500 --> 15:44.540
It really works.

15:46.170 --> 15:46.820
By the way,

15:48.180 --> 15:49.580
what's your name?

15:52.340 --> 15:53.140
My name is Fu.

15:54.980 --> 15:56.420
Fu?

15:58.540 --> 15:59.980
I think

16:00.540 --> 16:02.400
I did these things for you before.

16:03.420 --> 16:03.980
You did.

16:04.980 --> 16:05.980
Really?

16:07.340 --> 16:08.580
But why

16:09.740 --> 16:11.060
I can't remember?

16:12.540 --> 16:14.060
Are we really close?

16:16.420 --> 16:17.620
Not only are we close,

16:18.820 --> 16:20.420
we are a real couple.

16:21.380 --> 16:23.040
So you can't marry my brother.

16:23.500 --> 16:24.700
I will beg my brother,

16:25.020 --> 16:25.860
your brother,

16:26.540 --> 16:28.060
and the people in the Immortal Palace

16:28.060 --> 16:29.900
to agree to our marriage.

16:31.620 --> 16:33.080
As long as I can be with you,

16:33.740 --> 16:35.500
I'm willing to pay any price.

16:36.940 --> 16:37.740
In the future,

16:38.940 --> 16:40.740
we will have a lovely kid.

16:41.980 --> 16:43.780
They have no reason to reject us.

16:44.540 --> 16:46.380
But I really don't remember

16:46.860 --> 16:48.260
anything you said.

16:52.820 --> 16:53.540
F...

16:55.140 --> 16:55.340
F...

16:55.340 --> 16:55.780
Fu.

16:56.770 --> 16:58.300
No matter how much you said,

16:58.780 --> 17:00.420
I have to ask my brother

17:00.460 --> 17:01.780
what's going on first.

17:02.060 --> 17:03.420
If it's really like what you said

17:03.110 --> 17:07.569
♫The stars call the morning sky♫

17:03.540 --> 17:04.940
that we love each other so much,

17:04.940 --> 17:06.260
I wouldn't have

17:06.380 --> 17:08.180
forgotten you for no reason.

17:08.240 --> 17:12.750
♫May you feel relieved♫

17:10.579 --> 17:11.890
I made many mistakes

17:13.020 --> 17:14.300
that made you forget me.

17:14.010 --> 17:18.510
♫I long for a hug♫

17:16.780 --> 17:18.980
I'll ask your brother for forgiveness.

17:19.079 --> 17:24.329
♫Can I not just listen?♫

17:20.380 --> 17:21.040
From now on,

17:22.220 --> 17:23.700
you won't hate me anymore.

17:23.940 --> 17:25.460
You will fall in love with me

17:24.980 --> 17:28.420
♫I want to find our way through destiny♫

17:26.660 --> 17:28.520
and be willing to be with me again,

17:28.620 --> 17:29.300
right?

17:29.020 --> 17:34.640
♫I want to throw away the memory in exchange for you to come back♫

17:31.140 --> 17:32.600
Will I fall in love with you

17:33.500 --> 17:35.080
and be willing to be with you?

17:35.080 --> 17:39.940
♫Raise the glass to reincarnate the world♫

17:37.260 --> 17:38.060
Yes, you will.

17:40.140 --> 17:40.890
Fu.

17:40.230 --> 17:45.560
♫I'll wait for your response with no regrets♫

17:46.660 --> 17:50.320
♫I'll find the promised home for you♫

17:48.820 --> 17:49.420
Luo Ning.

17:50.060 --> 17:51.810
I have something to do.

17:50.840 --> 17:56.410
♫My heart aches and I will say yes again♫

17:52.140 --> 17:53.260
Wait for me here.

17:56.380 --> 17:56.820
You...

17:56.840 --> 18:02.190
♫When will we separate?♫

17:57.580 --> 17:58.580
You mean

17:58.900 --> 17:59.900
leaving me here

18:00.060 --> 18:01.180
and not letting me out?

18:01.180 --> 18:02.300
When I come back,

18:02.380 --> 18:10.160
♫Please don't tell us our ending in advance♫

18:02.460 --> 18:03.700
I'll take you out.

18:04.140 --> 18:04.860
I'll take you to

18:04.860 --> 18:05.940
wherever you want.

18:06.660 --> 18:07.810
But if

18:08.580 --> 18:09.580
I can't come back,

18:10.220 --> 18:11.860
your brother will take you out.

18:11.860 --> 18:12.660
My brother?

18:13.900 --> 18:15.620
Are you going to find my brother?

18:15.620 --> 18:16.940
But you just said

18:17.260 --> 18:18.740
you did many wrong things.

18:19.460 --> 18:21.060
Will he kill you?

18:23.740 --> 18:24.500
Maybe.

18:26.300 --> 18:28.100
But since you don't remember me,

18:28.540 --> 18:29.870
you won't be sad, right?

18:35.020 --> 18:36.300
This glazed bead is made by me

18:35.620 --> 18:40.170
♫I want to get close but I can't see clearly♫

18:36.940 --> 18:39.540
by copying sutras for years.

18:40.020 --> 18:40.820
It is said that

18:40.940 --> 18:45.120
♫Who arranged this rain?♫

18:41.140 --> 18:43.100
it can ward off evil and avoid disaster.

18:43.100 --> 18:43.940
Take it.

18:44.540 --> 18:45.540
Come back safely.

18:46.670 --> 18:51.020
♫I want to avoid but I meet you again♫

18:51.770 --> 18:56.530
♫I can't help but stay with you♫

18:55.900 --> 18:56.900
Come back safely.

18:57.620 --> 19:01.840
♫The endless mountains and seas condensed into raindrops♫

18:58.500 --> 18:59.820
I'll wait for you here.

19:01.700 --> 19:03.980
You've told me your name many times.

19:02.970 --> 19:07.520
♫I have walked thousands of miles with the feeling of missing you♫

19:04.580 --> 19:06.110
But I still can't remember.

19:08.500 --> 19:09.740
Your name is…

19:08.520 --> 19:13.030
♫I want to ask the prophecy where should I go♫

19:11.100 --> 19:11.940
Your

19:13.690 --> 19:19.560
♫For whom did the foreshadowing disappear?♫

19:14.420 --> 19:15.260
name is...

19:18.700 --> 19:19.580
is...

19:19.710 --> 19:23.190
♫I want to find our way through destiny♫

19:23.780 --> 19:29.420
♫I want to throw away the memory in exchange for you to come back♫

19:29.460 --> 19:30.620
My name is Fu.

19:29.810 --> 19:34.600
♫Raise the glass to reincarnate the world♫

19:34.960 --> 19:40.880
♫I'll wait for your response with no regrets♫

19:41.280 --> 19:45.300
♫I'll find the promised home for you♫

19:44.060 --> 19:45.260
Fu.

19:45.570 --> 19:51.460
♫My heart aches and I will say yes again♫

19:47.220 --> 19:48.860
Fu.

19:51.630 --> 19:56.640
♫When will we separate?♫

19:56.970 --> 20:04.960
♫Please don't tell us our ending in advance♫

20:09.020 --> 20:11.220
Fu.

20:17.300 --> 20:18.640
Fu.

20:18.640 --> 20:21.160
[Fu]

20:19.930 --> 20:21.140
With this,

20:21.140 --> 20:22.500
I won't forget.

20:24.460 --> 20:25.980
Fu.

20:31.030 --> 20:35.060
[Fu]

20:37.780 --> 20:39.020
Fu.

20:46.810 --> 20:48.410
How is the Great Wilderness?

20:49.220 --> 20:50.260
As you wish,

20:50.260 --> 20:51.620
someone fell into the trap

20:51.620 --> 20:53.750
in the center of the Great Wilderness.

20:54.900 --> 20:55.700
That's right.

20:56.180 --> 20:57.500
If they want to track me,

20:57.500 --> 20:59.430
they need to sacrifice something.

20:59.940 --> 21:00.900
Who fell into it?

21:01.460 --> 21:03.060
Only the Demon King in White.

21:03.900 --> 21:04.740
My brother?

21:06.420 --> 21:07.210
Shouldn't him bring Luo Ge

21:07.210 --> 21:08.020
and Wanwu

21:08.020 --> 21:08.690
together?

21:08.940 --> 21:09.870
On the contrary,

21:10.180 --> 21:11.580
he went there alone

21:11.940 --> 21:13.140
to distract them.

21:13.620 --> 21:15.940
Probably because he's afraid that people from the Immortal Palace

21:15.940 --> 21:17.290
will hurt you.

21:17.860 --> 21:19.610
That place is extremely dangerous.

21:19.610 --> 21:20.740
With my brother's cultivation,

21:20.740 --> 21:22.070
will he be okay in there?

21:22.220 --> 21:23.620
Luo Ge and the people from the Immortal Palace

21:23.620 --> 21:25.820
will probably be induced to chase Luo Ning.

21:25.820 --> 21:27.100
But we don't know

21:27.220 --> 21:28.880
if they can save your brother.

21:28.900 --> 21:30.030
Since Luo Ge is here,

21:30.100 --> 21:30.940
I can't

21:31.020 --> 21:32.350
involve in this matter.

21:41.250 --> 21:41.980
What is that?

21:42.820 --> 21:44.260
The Trap of Spiritual Power.

21:44.260 --> 21:45.940
Demon King was trapped just now.

21:45.940 --> 21:47.170
I wanted to save him.

21:47.660 --> 21:49.520
But when I got close to that place,

21:49.620 --> 21:51.580
my spiritual power became so uncontrollable

21:51.580 --> 21:53.110
that I can hardly use magic.

21:54.100 --> 21:55.100
I'm afraid this trap

21:55.100 --> 21:56.830
was set especially for us by Fu.

21:58.100 --> 21:58.900
Ge.

21:59.740 --> 22:01.540
Didn’t you say Ning is not here?

22:01.900 --> 22:03.930
It's none of our business that

22:04.180 --> 22:05.780
He Na was tricked into the trap by his brother.

22:05.780 --> 22:07.840
We don't have to take the risk for him.

22:07.900 --> 22:08.900
Immortal Master,

22:09.020 --> 22:10.020
He Na is my friend.

22:10.500 --> 22:11.740
Now that he's in trouble,

22:11.740 --> 22:12.860
I can’t stand by.

22:13.900 --> 22:14.700
Shang Yurong,

22:15.420 --> 22:16.970
the marriage is not completed.

22:16.970 --> 22:17.780
There are a lot of unsettled issues

22:17.780 --> 22:19.460
in the Immortal Palace and the Demon Palace.

22:19.460 --> 22:20.920
Why don't you go out first?

22:21.140 --> 22:22.540
Immortal Master can accompany me.

22:22.540 --> 22:22.900
OK.

22:23.500 --> 22:24.620
Be careful.

22:24.660 --> 22:25.260
Okay.

22:51.700 --> 22:52.180
Luo Ge.

22:59.700 --> 23:00.340
Luo Ge.

23:03.580 --> 23:04.340
I'm sorry.

23:05.540 --> 23:06.060
He Na.

23:07.100 --> 23:08.100
Didn't I remind you

23:08.100 --> 23:09.430
not to protect Fu again?

23:10.130 --> 23:12.330
But you hid his whereabouts on purpose.

23:14.940 --> 23:15.700
These days,

23:16.100 --> 23:17.560
I was busy with the wedding

23:17.620 --> 23:18.580
and neglected him.

23:18.580 --> 23:20.180
That's why he got the chance.

23:21.180 --> 23:21.780
Luo Ge.

23:22.580 --> 23:24.380
I'll try my best to find Luo Ning.

23:25.220 --> 23:26.820
That's not what I want.

23:28.410 --> 23:29.820
You must find Luo Ning.

23:40.100 --> 23:42.100
The terrestrial aura here is weird.

23:42.300 --> 23:44.100
It can confuse spiritual power.

23:48.740 --> 23:51.140
This is the center of the Great Wilderness.

23:51.290 --> 23:52.150
I didn't expect

23:52.380 --> 23:54.060
Fu subdued the remnants of the eagle demons

23:54.060 --> 23:55.720
and used this place to trap us.

23:56.460 --> 23:56.940
Luo Ge.

23:57.940 --> 23:59.220
I'll use the water energy

23:59.220 --> 24:00.950
to block the terrestrial aura.

24:01.020 --> 24:02.540
Break the encirclement of demons

24:02.540 --> 24:03.290
and leave.

24:06.650 --> 24:07.460
When Liu Shao and I

24:07.460 --> 24:08.920
were hunted down by Ao Hen,

24:09.700 --> 24:11.560
you protected us again and again.

24:13.620 --> 24:14.180
Fine.

24:15.220 --> 24:17.020
With the help of Immortal Luo Ge,

24:17.570 --> 24:18.620
I don't believe

24:20.660 --> 24:22.180
we can't break this trap.

24:37.220 --> 24:38.220
What should we do?

24:38.540 --> 24:39.260
Surround them.

24:39.260 --> 24:40.020
The terrestrial aura here

24:40.020 --> 24:41.080
is favorable to us.

24:41.380 --> 24:42.370
The longer it takes,

24:42.370 --> 24:43.500
the weaker they are.

24:44.380 --> 24:46.310
They will come out sooner or later.

24:58.020 --> 24:58.820
Stop.

25:03.780 --> 25:04.500
Greetings,

25:05.540 --> 25:06.540
Immortal Master.

25:09.050 --> 25:09.940
You

25:10.290 --> 25:11.860
have always been

25:12.100 --> 25:13.140
unruly.

25:13.740 --> 25:15.700
But after

25:15.700 --> 25:17.380
you got your brother and Luo Ge into trouble,

25:17.380 --> 25:19.300
you've become polite.

25:21.260 --> 25:23.130
What are you up to?

25:24.620 --> 25:25.210
You

25:25.650 --> 25:26.980
are Luo Ning's elder.

25:27.900 --> 25:29.160
It's reasonable for me

25:29.540 --> 25:30.300
to be polite.

25:31.020 --> 25:32.220
Luo Ning.

25:33.180 --> 25:34.780
Don't mention Luo Ning to me.

25:34.980 --> 25:36.700
Why did you get her involved

25:36.700 --> 25:37.960
and ruin her marriage?

25:40.780 --> 25:41.860
It's all my fault.

25:43.090 --> 25:44.580
After I rescue my brother,

25:45.780 --> 25:48.180
I will go to the Immortal Palace personally

25:48.260 --> 25:49.100
to apologize.

25:52.100 --> 25:53.820
Apologize?

25:54.780 --> 25:57.780
You made their marriage into such a big joke.

25:58.210 --> 26:00.010
Do you think you will be forgiven

26:00.060 --> 26:01.980
by saying you're sorry?

26:02.300 --> 26:03.900
Even if He Na, the Demon King,

26:04.020 --> 26:06.460
will kneel down and apologize,

26:06.460 --> 26:09.260
it depends on whether Immortal Luo Ge will accept it or not.

26:09.260 --> 26:11.590
He can't even discipline his own brother.

26:12.460 --> 26:13.130
I think

26:13.420 --> 26:15.900
He Na can't be the Demon King anymore.

26:18.500 --> 26:20.430
I'll make up my mistake at any cost.

26:20.540 --> 26:21.860
I can even

26:22.740 --> 26:23.670
give out my life.

26:24.220 --> 26:26.420
But please don't insult my brother.

26:27.820 --> 26:29.900
You stole your brother's marriage.

26:30.420 --> 26:32.500
How dare you still pretend?

26:40.540 --> 26:41.540
Immortal Master,

26:42.700 --> 26:43.830
you've gone too far.

27:04.500 --> 27:06.100
I didn't use all my strength.

27:06.380 --> 27:07.510
How could he be hurt?

27:21.020 --> 27:22.140
Kid.

27:22.660 --> 27:23.860
You are too young

27:26.100 --> 27:28.020
to fight me.

27:33.260 --> 27:33.810
Luo Ning.

27:39.050 --> 27:39.620
Luo Ning.

27:51.060 --> 27:52.790
Where does the music come from?

28:10.620 --> 28:11.880
Bone-Corroding Harp.

28:30.020 --> 28:31.350
Luo Ning must be nearby.

28:34.740 --> 28:36.740
Fu set a Protection Spell here.

28:37.460 --> 28:38.720
Where is the entrance?

28:46.620 --> 28:47.350
Crown Wheel,

28:47.700 --> 28:49.030
take me to the entrance.

29:08.300 --> 29:09.620
You know music well.

29:10.050 --> 29:11.540
I want to give this harp to you

29:11.540 --> 29:12.900
as your birthday gift.

29:15.220 --> 29:16.380
Does it have a name?

29:17.260 --> 29:19.290
It's made of the Love Wood

29:19.580 --> 29:22.060
which is also known as the Bone-Corroding Wood.

29:22.060 --> 29:24.790
That's why it's called the Bone-Corroding Harp.

29:25.060 --> 29:26.260
Love

29:26.460 --> 29:27.860
can corrode everything.

29:27.980 --> 29:28.710
We can't know

29:29.570 --> 29:31.260
if it's fortunate or unfortunate

29:31.260 --> 29:32.590
to meet the one you love.

29:33.700 --> 29:34.900
It's always a fortune

29:34.940 --> 29:35.620
to meet.

29:37.140 --> 29:39.270
But what if the ending is unfortunate?

29:39.500 --> 29:41.100
As long as it's my choice,

29:42.100 --> 29:43.100
whether

29:43.340 --> 29:44.740
the result is good or bad,

29:45.100 --> 29:46.230
I will not regret it.

30:18.420 --> 30:20.420
The Protection Spell disappeared.

30:30.660 --> 30:31.100
God of the Sun.

30:31.100 --> 30:31.660
Ze Shui.

30:33.100 --> 30:33.540
I...

30:34.180 --> 30:34.710
Liu Shao.

30:35.180 --> 30:36.040
I'm not Ze Shui.

30:36.170 --> 30:36.980
I'm Luo Ning.

30:39.020 --> 30:40.620
And I'm not the God of the Sun.

30:42.660 --> 30:44.620
It must be the Crown Wheel and the Bone-Corroding Harp

30:44.620 --> 30:47.880
that recalled the memories of Ze Shui and the God of the Sun.

30:49.060 --> 30:49.660
Here is...

30:50.980 --> 30:51.460
Look.

30:52.020 --> 30:54.050
Is it the same as my old house?

30:56.140 --> 30:56.940
It's that...

30:58.620 --> 30:59.140
that...

31:00.300 --> 31:01.260
that...

31:01.610 --> 31:02.260
Fu?

31:02.620 --> 31:03.180
Yes.

31:03.580 --> 31:05.300
He must have decorated this place.

31:05.300 --> 31:07.230
It looks like he prepared it for me.

31:07.460 --> 31:08.590
But I don't know why,

31:08.820 --> 31:09.740
after he left,

31:09.900 --> 31:11.360
I can't remember his face.

31:11.780 --> 31:13.060
When he was by my side,

31:13.300 --> 31:14.960
I couldn't remember his name.

31:15.860 --> 31:16.420
I...

31:19.660 --> 31:20.990
You don't remember him?

31:39.010 --> 31:40.980
Use your water energy to resist the evil spirit.

31:40.980 --> 31:42.310
I will use the Moon Sword

31:42.460 --> 31:43.900
to break the encirclement of demons.

31:43.900 --> 31:44.460
Okay.

31:53.060 --> 31:53.980
You mean

31:54.100 --> 31:55.220
that boy

31:55.420 --> 31:56.380
and my brother

31:56.660 --> 31:57.740
are all here.

31:58.660 --> 31:59.460
Your brother and He Na

31:59.460 --> 32:00.700
were lured here by Fu.

32:01.180 --> 32:02.710
I'm afraid he set an ambush.

32:04.940 --> 32:06.020
Fu set an ambush?

32:06.740 --> 32:08.800
Is he going to do something bad again?

32:09.940 --> 32:10.460
Again?

32:12.620 --> 32:14.020
Why should I say "again"?

32:15.260 --> 32:16.860
How many things had happened

32:17.100 --> 32:18.540
between us?

32:20.380 --> 32:22.110
Why can't I remember anything?

32:35.780 --> 32:36.780
Immortal Master.

32:37.340 --> 32:37.860
Fu.

32:38.260 --> 32:39.260
Immortal Master.

32:39.780 --> 32:40.780
Immortal Master.

32:40.940 --> 32:41.500
Fu.

32:42.300 --> 32:42.830
Brother.

32:43.020 --> 32:44.020
Immortal Master.

32:45.500 --> 32:46.220
Ge.

32:46.980 --> 32:47.780
Ge.

32:49.060 --> 32:50.380
Don’t let him go.

32:52.300 --> 32:53.700
I didn't mean to hurt him.

32:54.260 --> 32:55.820
He must have done this

32:56.260 --> 32:58.660
because he's been corroded by evil things.

32:59.020 --> 33:01.260
He may harm the three worlds

33:01.260 --> 33:02.820
and the people at any time.

33:03.300 --> 33:04.380
Nonsense!

33:04.700 --> 33:05.820
Nonsense!

33:06.460 --> 33:08.930
How could he resist my evil spirit?

33:11.100 --> 33:11.940
Ge.

33:12.700 --> 33:13.460
Look.

33:17.260 --> 33:18.190
The evil spirit.

33:18.460 --> 33:18.900
Fu.

33:19.260 --> 33:20.460
Go back with me first.

33:35.860 --> 33:37.340
I don't want to do this.

33:38.420 --> 33:39.900
But you forced me.

34:10.580 --> 34:11.340
Fu!

34:27.780 --> 34:28.620
Luo Ning.

34:44.139 --> 34:44.739
Luo Ning.

34:53.900 --> 34:54.500
Luo Ning.

34:55.540 --> 34:56.219
Luo Ning.

34:57.420 --> 34:58.220
You will be fine.

34:58.220 --> 34:59.620
I'll save you right away.

34:59.940 --> 35:00.500
Luo Ning.

35:01.580 --> 35:02.170
Luo Ning.

35:03.450 --> 35:04.140
Luo Ning!

35:12.890 --> 35:13.620
Luo Ning.

35:18.300 --> 35:18.980
Luo Ning.

35:28.940 --> 35:30.500
Brother, don't…

35:31.900 --> 35:33.620
don't kill him

35:34.780 --> 35:37.260
and don't do useless healing.

35:47.030 --> 35:48.580
[Fu]

35:49.380 --> 35:52.140
Fu.

35:58.540 --> 35:59.500
With this,

36:01.850 --> 36:03.260
I won't forget.

36:04.860 --> 36:05.300
No.

36:06.340 --> 36:06.940
Luo Ning.

36:08.340 --> 36:10.000
You should have forgotten me.

36:10.780 --> 36:12.580
If you had forgotten me earlier,

36:12.820 --> 36:14.890
this wouldn't have happened.

36:19.460 --> 36:20.820
I'm sorry.

36:23.380 --> 36:23.910
Luo Ning.

36:24.300 --> 36:24.860
Luo Ning.

36:25.620 --> 36:26.210
Luo Ning.

36:26.540 --> 36:27.220
Fu.

36:30.260 --> 36:31.060
I really

36:32.900 --> 36:34.340
can't remember you.

36:36.900 --> 36:39.340
But I really want to remember

36:40.380 --> 36:41.500
what had happened

36:42.580 --> 36:44.980
between us.

36:46.740 --> 36:47.500
Many...

36:48.690 --> 36:50.660
many things had happened between us.

36:50.660 --> 36:51.420
Many things.

36:53.340 --> 36:56.460
You're not good at crafting.

36:56.860 --> 36:57.940
But

36:58.170 --> 37:00.570
you deal with things quite interestingly.

37:01.580 --> 37:02.710
Leave through here.

37:02.740 --> 37:04.140
What if I don't come back?

37:06.180 --> 37:07.860
If you don't come back,

37:09.620 --> 37:11.350
I don't think I can do anything.

37:12.020 --> 37:13.420
What are you talking about?

37:13.420 --> 37:15.280
I mean you shouldn't fight again.

37:17.830 --> 37:20.940
♫On rainy days, wind blows smoke♫

37:18.970 --> 37:20.060
Even you dislike me

37:20.850 --> 37:22.180
because I am an aquatic monster

37:20.940 --> 37:23.040
♫Into circles♫

37:22.820 --> 37:24.100
that will die without water, right?

37:24.100 --> 37:25.580
You're not a monster.

37:24.170 --> 37:27.030
♫On both sides, I'm chanting♫

37:27.320 --> 37:29.130
♫The night is sleepless♫

37:27.860 --> 37:28.780
Although

37:29.260 --> 37:30.430
you are not a good person,

37:30.430 --> 37:33.450
♫The shadows of the moon are incomplete, and people are in love♫

37:31.300 --> 37:33.160
you're definitely not a monster.

37:33.580 --> 37:35.760
♫A cocoon of shadows♫

37:36.140 --> 37:37.060
Anyway, this curse

37:36.180 --> 37:41.560
♫Your promise, my fate♫

37:37.450 --> 37:39.100
has trapped our clan for ten thousand years.

37:39.100 --> 37:40.430
No matter what it takes,

37:40.540 --> 37:41.740
I will lift it.

37:43.130 --> 37:44.420
No crooked ways.

37:43.160 --> 37:46.350
♫In spring, seasons changed♫

37:45.060 --> 37:45.850
OK.

37:46.390 --> 37:48.410
♫But my heart is still the same♫

37:46.660 --> 37:47.820
Anything you say.

37:48.140 --> 37:49.140
No crooked ways.

37:49.140 --> 37:49.700
Okay?

37:49.500 --> 37:52.560
♫Back to the sky, the clouds passing by♫

37:52.220 --> 37:53.700
But I still remember

37:52.560 --> 37:54.160
♫Is like the things we went through♫

37:54.980 --> 37:56.100
I've always

37:55.800 --> 37:58.490
♫Beside the lake, on the boat♫

37:58.340 --> 37:59.060
wanted to

37:58.860 --> 38:00.800
♫The moment we passed each other♫

37:59.700 --> 38:00.230
Luo Ning.

38:01.020 --> 38:02.540
lift the curse for one person.

38:01.470 --> 38:07.220
♫Can compare with the rest of my life♫

38:04.100 --> 38:04.980
Is that

38:07.600 --> 38:12.890
♫I look at my love and send it to the clouds outside the garden♫

38:08.130 --> 38:09.540
you?

38:10.140 --> 38:10.820
Yes.

38:11.380 --> 38:12.460
It's me.

38:13.860 --> 38:19.900
♫Looking at your ageless face at the end of the world♫

38:13.940 --> 38:15.800
But you don't have to do anything.

38:16.100 --> 38:18.820
I just want you to be fine.

38:20.320 --> 38:26.540
♫You put the winter snow in your ears and can’t hear it♫

38:24.100 --> 38:25.230
Ten thousand years…

38:26.540 --> 38:32.760
♫When the flowers stop falling, you and I will miss each other♫

38:27.100 --> 38:28.960
Ten thousand years of punishment

38:30.380 --> 38:32.020
has been long enough.

38:32.760 --> 38:38.130
♫Everything in the world passes before understanding♫

38:39.060 --> 38:45.060
♫After the missing, my face is still young♫

38:45.440 --> 38:51.450
